  firstLines:
  - (A massive pipe organ, mostly intact. There are 8 stops, in two columns of 4,
    all marked with a purple eye.)
  - "Please don't tell me I need to make the organ work\u2026"
  - I've never touched an organ in my life!
  - (You look back at the Sighted Angel. It offers no further guidance.)
  - "(If the keys don't work, the only thing you can mess with is the stops\u2026)"
  laterLines:
  - (A massive pipe organ, mostly intact. There are 8 stops, in two columns of 4,
    all marked with a purple eye.)
  - (Mess with the stops?)
  foundPieceLines:
  - (Something shimmers by the organ pedal.)
  - (You hadn't noticed it before, but a piece of coloured glass sits at the base
    of the instrument.)
  - (You pick it up.)
