  dialogueBox: {fileID: 1266156441}
  tapeOutLines:
  - '*You pulled out your measuring tape and latch it onto the cobblestone floor.
    Now to go to the opposite side of the room*'
  solvedLines:
  - The room is 42 metres by 31 metres.
  - (Something glints on the floor near your foot.)
  - (A piece of coloured glass. Weird.)
  - (You pick it up.)
  - That was painless. Mostly. Okay, I'm out of here.
  - (You hear a distinct click.)
  - '..? '
  wallLengthLines:
  - "42 metres\u2026 Alright, that's the floor length. Now for the width."
  - "31 metres\u2026 Alright, that's the width."
